title: MSSQL Database Backup to External Location
id: 5da67347-b0d0-4df9-b395-1573ddbc52fe
status: experimental
description: Detects SQL Server BACKUP DATABASE to a UNC path or non-standard location, a technique to copy full database contents out for exfiltration under the guise of a backup.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1530/
logsource:
  category: application
  product: mssql
detection:
  selection:
    query_text|contains: 'BACKUP DATABASE'
    query_text|contains:
      - '\\\\'
      - 'DISK ='
  condition: selection
fields:
  - query_text
  - user_name
  - client_ip
falsepositives:
  - Scheduled database backups
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.collection
  - attack.t1530
